AppImage Type 2 Runtime, release 20251108
Source: https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime/tree/dd6cebedcbddde9c82f89b011e8e1d40b6e43868
License source: LICENSE at the same revision (unmodified).
The embedded runtime includes statically linked third-party libraries.
The upstream LICENSE identifies their terms. Public distribution requires
review of the complete notices and applicable source-delivery obligations.

The pinned Runtime build script downloads libfuse 3.15.0 and squashfuse 0.5.2:
https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime/blob/dd6cebedcbddde9c82f89b011e8e1d40b6e43868/scripts/common/install-dependencies.sh
The corresponding upstream license texts are included here unchanged.
libfuse is patched by the Runtime build; the patch is in patches/libfuse.
The Runtime Makefile also links mimalloc, in addition to the libraries
identified in the upstream LICENSE. Exact Alpine-provided library revisions
and complete redistribution obligations remain to be verified.
